        "Content": "TO LET - *** All enquiries by email only to dennehyauctioneers.rentals@gmail.com*** Please include a short bio with your email.\r\n\r\nDennehy Auctioneers are delighted to offer modernised and refurbished, large, first floor, furnished, one bedroom apartment in annex of private period residence in delightful countryside setting approximately 5 km east of Carrigaline. Own door & exclusive stairwell access.\r\nOwn transport essential. Excellent parking.\r\n\r\nAccommodation: Stairwell entrance, hall, Open Plan Kitchen/Dining/Living Room, Bedroom and Shower Room.\r\n\r\nFurniture: Two seater couch, coffee table, occasional table, lamp, window seat, kitchen table & four chairs, double bed, bedside lockers, lamp.\r\n\r\nAppliances: Fridge-freezer, oven, hob, washing machine, slimline dishwasher.\r\n\r\nHeating: Electric.\r\n\r\nRent: €1,150 inclusive of refuse."
